aspect ratio to avoid black bars. Staying within these specs prevents upload errors and keeps your cover looking crisp.\"}]]}]\n1a:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"theme-color\",\"content\":\"#ffffff\",\"media\":\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"theme-color\",\"content\":\"#000000\",\"media\":\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"}]]\n25:I[6869,[],\"IconMark\"]\n17:null\n1c:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"YouTube Thumbnail Preview - Test Video Layouts Online | Creators Units\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Test how your thumbnails look before publishing. Preview on desktop homepage, mobile feed, search results, and sidebar side-by-side.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"author\",\"content\":\"Creators Units\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"creator tools, image compressor, qr generator, youtube tag extractor, text case converter, fancy text generator, link in bio\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"content\":\"index, follow\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"5\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://creatorunits.com/tools/creator/youtube-thumbnail-preview\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"YouTube Thumbnail Preview - Test Video Layouts Online | Creators Units\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"Test how your thumbnails look before publishing. Preview on desktop homepage, mobile feed, search results, and sidebar side-by-side.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https://creatorunits.com/og-image.png\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"og:image:width\",\"content\":\"1200\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"property\":\"og:image:height\",\"content\":\"630\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"property\":\"og:image:alt\",\"content\":\"YouTube Thumbnail Preview - Creators Units\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"website\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"14\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"YouTube Thumbnail Preview - Test Video Layouts Online | Creators Units\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Test how your thumbnails look before publishing. Preview on desktop homepage, mobile feed, search results, and sidebar side-by-side.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"16\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://creatorunits.com/og-image.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"17\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.svg\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"18\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.svg\"}],[\"$\",\"$L25\",\"19\",{}]]\n","/tools/$d$category/$d$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n7:I[6119,[\"9756\",\"static/chunks/9756-ee0a5eec26815695.js\",\"3857\",\"static/chunks/app/tools/%5Bcategory%5D/%5Bslug%5D/page-94e3d5017b9f97f7.js\"],\"default\"]\n8:I[8500,[\"9756\",\"static/chunks/9756-ee0a5eec26815695.js\",\"3857\",\"static/chunks/app/tools/%5Bcategory%5D/%5Bslug%5D/page-94e3d5017b9f97f7.js\"],\"\"]\n9:I[9400,[\"9756\",\"static/chunks/9756-ee0a5eec26815695.js\",\"3857\",\"static/chunks/app/tools/%5Bcategory%5D/%5Bslug%5D/page-94e3d5017b9f97f7.js\"],\"default\"]\nc:I[484,[],\"OutletBoundary\"]\nd:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n2:T9e3,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is a YouTube thumbnail preview tool?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A YouTube thumbnail preview tool is a simulator that allows creators to upload their cover graphics and see how they appear within various YouTube page mockups. You can view your thumbnail inside simulated desktop homepages, mobile search feeds, and desktop sidebars to verify how it competes visually against surrounding content layouts.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why should I preview thumbnails before publishing?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A thumbnail might look great at full screen, but lose detail or readability when scaled down on a mobile screen. Previewing lets you catch unreadable text, low-contrast design issues, or cluttered compositions before you publish, helping you make adjustments to maximize your video's potential click-through rate. These small fixes often make the difference between a viewer clicking or scrolling past.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How will my thumbnail appear on mobile devices?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"On mobile devices, thumbnails are scaled down significantly, and titles are often truncated to just two lines. By testing your thumbnail in our mobile feed simulator, you can verify if your typography remains legible on small screens and check if vital graphic elements are cut off by overlay badges. This ensures your design communicates effectively even at the smallest display size.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can thumbnail previews improve click-through rate?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, previewing helps you optimize visual hierarchy. You can compare your draft thumbnail side-by-side with general YouTube search layouts, helping you design cover art that is more eye-catching. A high-contrast, clear thumbnail directly drives clicks, which signals search engines to recommend your video to a broader audience. Better visuals lead to better rankings over time.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What thumbnail size works best for YouTube?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"YouTube recommends a resolution of 1280 by 720 pixels, with a minimum width of 640 pixels. It must be saved in JPG, GIF, or PNG format and keep under the 2MB file size limit. Standard widescreen videos should always use a 16:9 aspect ratio to avoid black bars. Staying within these specs prevents upload errors and keeps your cover looking crisp.\"}}]}0:{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebApplication\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"YouTube Thumbnail Preview\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://creatorunits.com/tools/creator/youtube-thumbnail-preview\\\",\\\"applicationCategory\\\":\\\"UtilityApplication\\\",\\\"operatingSystem\\\":\\\"All\\\",\\\"browserRequirements\\\":\\\"Requires HTML5, Javascript, Canvas\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Preview your video thumbnails inside simulated YouTube search, homepage, and sidebar widgets.\\\"}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://creatorunits.com/\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Creator Tools\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://creatorunits.com/category/creator\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"YouTube Thumbnail Preview\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://creatorunits.com/tools/creator/youtube-thumbnail-preview\\\"}]}\"}}],\"$L3\",\"$L4\",\"$L5\"],null,\"$L6\"]}],\"isPartial\":false,\"staleTime\":300,\"varyParams\":null,\"buildId\":\"3_ueScIKWdVRBBS3A0Anp\"}\n3:[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{}]\n4:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"main-content section\",\"id\":\"main-content\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"style\":{\"marginBottom\":\"1rem\",\"fontSize\":\"0.85rem\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"